## fix(mapping-ui): wire Designer "Unmap all" via addEventListener for reliable confirm popup

**Context:** Follow-up to the "Unmap all" work below. The Designer button was wired with an inline `onclick="confirmResetMappings()"`, which reintroduced the inline-handler pattern the team deliberately dropped in v0.2.0 (in favor of id-based `addEventListener`). Switched it to the same robust wiring as the Information button so the confirmation dialog (`showConfirmDialog`) fires reliably before any mappings are cleared.

